<title>USA: Moto Photo names Frank Montano president.</title>
<headline>Moto Photo names Frank Montano president.</headline>
<dateline>DAYTON, Ohio 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Moto Photo Inc said on Wednesday that it named Frank Montano as president and chief operating officer.  </p>
<p>Montana replaces Michael Adler, who continues as chairman and chief executive officer.</p>
<p>Moto Photo is a franchiser and operator of one-hour photofinishing labs and portrait studios.</p>
<p>-- ((New York newsdesk 212-859-1611))</p>
</text>
